<title>JAPAN: Yaohan shares fall daily limit to 93 yen in Tokyo.</title>
<headline>Yaohan shares fall daily limit to 93 yen in Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Yaohan Japan Corp briefly fell their daily limit to 93 yen on Friday afternoon, after having been ask-only for most of the session.</p>
</text>
